  "description": "Cha Do-won is a genius national team athlete who knew nothing but shooting. From the very day he was reunited with his first love, Seo Yi-jeong, after nine years, he found himself having wet dreams about him...\n\nThe Yi-jeong he met in his dreams was sensual and candid. However, fearing that he might never make it onto the national team if things continued like this, Do-won went out of his way to seek out Yi-jeong, whom he had previously avoided.\n\n*“Hyung, why did you kiss me?”  \n“I did it because I wanted to sleep with you.”* *(Source: MrBlue, translated)*\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000079851)",
